                                                "example_id": "49b98369-c425-4137-9d84-1f59635b1af5",
                                                "sense_id": "ff64a89a-29c9-38ff-8b1b-69f7246e8f45",
                                                "text": "Take several “before” pictures of your whole body and include a “belfie” (butt selfie) the day before you start the program. Do it from different angles — front, side, and back."
